# SocratiCode indexer exclusions for dsh-agent-teams.
#
# The code that matters is `src/` (TypeScript) plus `scripts/` (the verification
# suite, which is the executable specification of the plugin's behavior).
# Everything excluded below is either generated, vendored, or a dated audit
# artifact. The curated documents that *are* worth retrieving are registered as
# context artifacts in `.socraticodecontextartifacts.json` instead of being
# floated into the code index.

# Generated output and local state (also covered by .gitignore)
lib/
node_modules/
*.tsbuildinfo
.agent-teams/
tmp/

# Vendored community skills: upstream material pinned by commit hash, 245 files
# of prose. Preserved as-is for maintenance tooling, never read as project code.
skills/dsh-benchmark-case/
skills/dsh-plugin-development/
skills/dsh-upgrade-audit/
skills/plugin-heavy-dep/
skills/plugin-release/
skills/plugin-runtime-debug/
skills/plugin-test/
skills/plugin-upgrade/
skills/plugin-workflow/
skills/plugin-write/
.dsh/
.agents/

# Legacy Chinese documentation: frozen by the policy in AGENTS.md ("Documentation
# language policy"). Not read, not maintained, not indexed. Everything reachable
# here is either a dated audit, a release-note archive, vendored skill prose in
# Chinese, or the Chinese README. The English sources of the same material stay
# in the index.
README_ZH.md
*.zh-CN.md

# Dated audit output: run logs, cohort JSON, screenshots, transcripts. ~6 MB of
# one-off evidence under docs/, plus release notes that restate the same facts.
# The nine curated English docs/*.md guides stay in the index and are additionally
# registered as context artifacts; the dated Chinese audits below do not.
docs/compatibility-audit-2026-09-05/
docs/harness-0.1.5-rc.1-audit-2026-09-10/
docs/maintenance-2026-09-06/
docs/releases/
docs/session-latency-audit-2026-09-12/
docs/theme-support-2026-09-11/
docs/upgrade-skill-study-2026-09-06/
release-notes/

# Binary art: hero images, panel screenshots, UI mockups
assets/

# Local scratch from this working copy: setup notes, run logs, issue snapshots.
# Deliberately outside the index - it is about this machine, not about the code.
.local/

# Binary art that slips past assets/
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.zip
